---
source: crates/sb/tests/docker.rs
expression: "help(&[\"docker\", \"--help\"])"
---

  Manage Docker containers managed by Saltbox

  USAGE

    sb docker [command] [--flags]

  COMMANDS

    logs               Display logs of Docker containers
    ps [--flags]       List Docker containers with port mappings
    restart [--flags]  Restart Docker containers managed by Saltbox
    start              Start Docker containers managed by Saltbox
    stop [--flags]     Stop Docker containers managed by Saltbox

  FLAGS

    --color            Controls when to use color (auto)
    -h --help          Help for docker
